1
00:00:00,731 --> 00:00:03,361
(Howard:)Raj, you just
got a text.

2
00:00:03,367 --> 00:00:05,637
(Howard:)The probe turned
on. It's fine.

3
00:00:06,604 --> 00:00:09,004
(sighs)
Oh, good.

4
00:00:10,041 --> 00:00:12,811
Namaste, Grandpa.

5
00:00:20,551 --> 00:00:22,751
(Leonard:)I thought
this was gonna be boring,

6
00:00:22,753 --> 00:00:24,583
(Leonard:)but it's actually kind of fun.

7
00:00:24,589 --> 00:00:28,559
(Penny:)Don't tell Amy that. We'll
be here every Sunday.

8
00:00:28,559 --> 00:00:31,129
(Amy:)Sheldon, that really is
an excellent basket.

9
00:00:31,129 --> 00:00:32,899
(Sheldon:)It's not a basket.

10
00:00:32,897 --> 00:00:36,467
(Sheldon:)It's a soldier's helmet
from 16th century China.

11
00:00:39,904 --> 00:00:41,574
(Amy:)Very nice.

12
00:00:41,572 --> 00:00:44,642
(Raj:)Yeah, it
looks great.

13
00:00:45,943 --> 00:00:49,013
(Sheldon:)I saw that.

14
00:00:56,621 --> 00:00:59,821
(Leonard:)Well, roomie,
it's only one night a week,

15
00:00:59,824 --> 00:01:01,094
(Leonard:)but it's a start.

16
00:01:01,092 --> 00:01:02,992
(Penny:)I know. I'm really
proud of Sheldon.

17
00:01:02,994 --> 00:01:04,924
(Leonard:)Yeah, I'm proud of him, too.

18
00:01:04,929 --> 00:01:06,759
SHELDON:
Can you keep it
down? Some of us

19
00:01:06,764 --> 00:01:09,834
(Sheldon(in Penny's living room):)are trying
to sleep out here.

